  The United States played the USSR in the semi-finals, winning 102-88, and then played Yugoslavia in the final.  The Yugoslavs pushed the Americans but the US team prevailed, 77-70. The USA team was led by " [:a {:href "/athletes/5226"} "Teresa Edwards"] ", a point guard who had also won gold in 1984, and would go on to win 5 Olympic medals, including 4 gold medals, before ending her career after the 2000 Sydney Olympics."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button681657", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button681657').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Games Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "GP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Scoring Average"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Time Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "TP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Disqualifications"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "2-point Field Goals Made"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "2-point Field Goals Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "2-point Field Goals %"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3-point Field Goals Made"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3-point Field Goals Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "3-point Field Goals %"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Total Field Goals", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "FG"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Total Field Goals %", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "FG%"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Free Throws", :class "split", :style "displa